<p>A Ugandan court sentenced Christopher Okello Onyum, 38, to death after convicting him of murdering four young children at an early childhood development center in Gaba, a suburb of Kampala, earlier in April. The children were described as toddlers, with reported ages ranging from about one to three years old. The case followed an April 2 attack at a nursery school in Kampala in which the children were fatally stabbed. Justice Alice Komuhangi Khauka rejected Onyum&#x27;s insanity plea, and The EastAfrican reported that the court found the killings were planned rather than the result of mental illness. GBC Ghana reported that the ruling was delivered on Thursday at a makeshift court in the Ggaba community, after what ABC News described as a speedy trial. Newsbeast reported that parents of the victims were in the courtroom when the verdict was announced.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/GmrayJ5Bn1HFDikFJg2YQGtuOtOoCFiRJfKux7tQSeMAXzkq_zFtXqK9W8ETOH1mgtPmd8MmHZw2qgU9Z2p9KJBZmenCiCiEEoxxd_axXT_9AamORZ0cR0uif4RJObKhfgOUWPfHAv4' alt='The High Court in Kampala sentenced Christopher Okello Onyum, 38, to death after convicting him of murdering four toddlers.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Sentence: The BBC reported that Onyum was sentenced to death by hanging.</li><li>Victims: Newsbeast described the victims as three boys and one girl.</li><li>Public reaction: Tuoi Tre said the attack drew public outrage and concern over pupil safety in Uganda.</li><li>Identity: Tori.ng and Newsbeast described Onyum as Ugandan-American.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Justice Alice Komuhangi Khauka: Newsbeast reported that the judge said Onyum acted without fear or shame and without regard for the value of human life. (<a href='https://www.newsbeast.gr/world/arthro/13067151/ougkanta-thanatos-gia-ton-andra-pou-dolofonise-4-nipia'>Newsbeast</a>)</li><li>Christopher Okello Onyum: Newsbeast reported that Onyum did not answer when asked why he should not be sentenced to death. (<a href='https://www.newsbeast.gr/world/arthro/13067151/ougkanta-thanatos-gia-ton-andra-pou-dolofonise-4-nipia'>Newsbeast</a>)</li><li>Courtroom audience: Newsbeast reported that applause followed the verdict. (<a href='https://www.newsbeast.gr/world/arthro/13067151/ougkanta-thanatos-gia-ton-andra-pou-dolofonise-4-nipia'>Newsbeast</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/uganda-court-sentences-man-to-death-for-killing-four-young-children-at-nursery-school'>Uganda court sentences man to death for killing four young children at nursery school</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/4/30/uganda-court-sentences-man-to-death-for-killing-four-children-at-nursery'>Uganda court sentences man to death for killing four children at nursery</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://allafrica.com/stories/202605010073.html'>Uganda: Man Who Murdered Toddlers Sentenced to Death</a> - allafrica.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c3d2vzmgekjo'>Man sentenced to death for murder of toddlers at Ugandan nursery</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/judge-sentences-ugandan-man-death-speedy-trial-killing-132553293'>Judge sentences Ugandan man to death following speedy trial for killing 4 children</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://news.tuoitre.vn/uganda-court-sentences-man-to-death-for-killing-4-young-children-at-nursery-school-103260501111711648.htm'>Uganda court sentences man to death for killing 4 young children at nursery school</a> - tuoitre.vn</li><li><a href='https://www.gbcghanaonline.com/features/man-sentenced-to-death-for-murder-of-four-toddlers-at-ugandan-nursery-school/2026/'>Man sentenced to death for murder of four toddlers at Ugandan nursery school</a> - gbcghanaonline.com</li><li><a href='https://www.newtimes.co.rw/article/35294/news/crime/uganda-man-who-murdered-toddlers-sentenced-to-death'>Uganda: Man who murdered toddlers se